{"id":"reference/unreachable","kind":"langref","title":"unreachable","sourceUrl":"https://ziglang.org/documentation/0.17.0/#unreachable","file":"reference/unreachable.json","headings":[{"depth":2,"slug":"unreachable","text":"unreachable"},{"depth":3,"slug":"Basics","text":"基础"},{"depth":3,"slug":"At-Compile-Time","text":"编译时"}],"html":"<h2 id=\"unreachable\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#unreachable\">unreachable</a></h2>\n\n      <p>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#debug\">debug</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#safe\">safe</a> 模式下，<code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 会生成对 <code>panic</code> 的调用，并传入消息 <code>reached unreachable code</code>。</p>\n      <p>在 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#fast\">fast</a> 和 <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#small\">small</a> 模式下，优化器会利用永远不会执行到 <code><span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span></code> 代码这一假设进行优化。</p>\n      <h3 id=\"Basics\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#Basics\">基础</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_unreachable.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// unreachable 用于断言控制流永远不会到达</span>\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 某个特定位置：</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"basic math\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> x = <span class=\"tok-number\">1</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> y = <span class=\"tok-number\">2</span>;\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (x + y != <span class=\"tok-number\">3</span>) {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>;\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_unreachable.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_unreachable.test.basic math...OK\nAll 1 tests passed.\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>实际上，<code>std.debug.assert</code> 就是这样实现的：</p>\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_assertion_failure.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-comment\">// std.debug.assert 就是这样实现的</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">assert</span>(ok: <span class=\"tok-type\">bool</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">void</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">if</span> (!ok) <span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>; <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 断言失败</span>\n}\n\n<span class=\"tok-comment\">// 此测试会失败，因为执行到了 unreachable。</span>\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"this will fail\"</span> {\n    assert(<span class=\"tok-null\">false</span>);\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_assertion_failure.zig</kbd>\n1/1 test_assertion_failure.test.this will fail...thread 708684 panic: reached unreachable code\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_assertion_failure.zig:3:14: 0x124c5a9 in assert (test_assertion_failure.zig)\n    if (!ok) unreachable; // assertion failure\n             ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_assertion_failure.zig:8:11: 0x124c57e in test.this will fail (test_assertion_failure.zig)\n    assert(false);\n          ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:295:25: 0x1200951 in mainTerminal (test_runner.zig)\n        if (test_fn.func()) |_| {\n                        ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/compiler/test_runner.zig:74:28: 0x1200132 in main (test_runner.zig)\n        return mainTerminal(init);\n                           ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:789:88: 0x11fc8cf in callMain (std.zig)\n    if (fn_info.param_types[0].? == std.process.Init.Minimal) return wrapMain(root.main(.{\n                                                                                       ^\n/home/andy/src/zig/lib/std/start.zig:248:5: 0x11fc2b1 in _start (std.zig)\n    asm volatile (switch (native_arch) {\n    ^\nerror: the following test command terminated with signal ABRT:\n/home/andy/src/zig/.zig-cache/o/fd00e88bd13ffee28e46bc2aecbfd750/test --seed=0x3b92b89e\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      \n      <h3 id=\"At-Compile-Time\"><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/unreachable/#At-Compile-Time\">编译时</a></h3>\n\n      <figure><figcaption class=\"zig-cap\"><cite class=\"file\">test_comptime_unreachable.zig</cite></figcaption><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> assert = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@import</span>(<span class=\"tok-str\">\"std\"</span>).debug.assert;\n\n<span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> <span class=\"tok-str\">\"type of unreachable\"</span> {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> {\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// unreachable 的类型是 noreturn。</span>\n\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 但这个断言仍然无法编译，因为</span>\n        <span class=\"tok-comment\">// 编译时执行 unreachable 表达式会产生编译错误。</span>\n\n        assert(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">unreachable</span>) == <span class=\"tok-type\">noreturn</span>);\n    }\n}</code></pre></figure><figure><figcaption class=\"shell-cap\">命令行</figcaption><pre><samp>$ <kbd>zig test test_comptime_unreachable.zig</kbd>\n<span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_comptime_unreachable.zig:10:16: </span><span class=\"sgr-31m\">error: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">unreachable code\n</span>        assert(@TypeOf(unreachable) == noreturn);\n               <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n</span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">/home/andy/src/zig/doc/langref/test_comptime_unreachable.zig:10:24: </span><span class=\"sgr-36m\">note: </span><span class=\"sgr-1m\">control flow is diverted here\n</span>        assert(@TypeOf(unreachable) == noreturn);\n                       <span class=\"sgr-32m\">^~~~~~~~~~~\n</span>\n</samp></pre></figure>\n\n      <p>另见：</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Zig-Test/#Zig-Test\">Zig 测试</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/Optimization-Mode/#Optimization-Mode\">优化模式</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/reference/comptime/#comptime\">comptime</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n      \n      \n      ","translation":{"total":21,"translated":21}}
